/**

 @page tests_swift2_hydro_simple_sph_sedov_blast_3D  Sedov Blast 3D (Simple SPH)


Injects (relatively) high energy into the center of a uniform gas field, leading
to a Sedov-Taylor blast. Here in 1D.
See e.g. Section 4 in Springel and Hernquist, Mon. Not. R. Astron. Soc. 333,
649–664 (2002).
(https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2002MNRAS.333..649S/abstract)



## Create the setup

To create the setup and executable, use the

	python3 sedov.py

script. Consult the ```run.sh`` script for a possible configuration.


## Postprocessing

use the script

        python3 plotSolution.py

to generate the output plot. It should look something like this:


  @image html SedovBlastN64.png

 */


